#N canvas 20 20 3200 1400 12;
#X declare -lib pdlua;
#X text 20 20 u_voices -- a song's voices and the page on show. A row of the Launchpad is a voice: its right button chooses the machine \, names it and sets it \, and the left button across from it is what it does. The rules are in u_voices.lua. ref/module/voices.md, f 58;
#X text 700 20 inlet 1: u_map's <arg> <value>. inlet 2: the phone's voices <cmd> ... \, through u_net. Outlet 1: to g_grid. Outlet 2: to the c_melody engines. Outlet 3: machine <machine> \, to c_synth. Outlet 4: voices <atoms> \, to u_net. The mode bus \, the state bus and err are said here., f 58;
